title: Operation Faustschlag
subtitle: The Germans are rapidly advancing!
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
tags: event
view-if: german_waiting_timer = 0 and german_negotiations = 3
on-arrival: enemy_front = best_enemy_front; front = best_front; attacking = 0; in_defensive_battle = 1; german_offensive_timer = 1 if refuse_treaty
set-jump: operation_faustschlag.post_battle
go-to: battle

= Operation Faustschlag

As it turns out, the Germans weren't bluffing at Brest-Litovsk. They have launched their offense, and their forces are rapidly advancing across the entire front, capturing an immense amount of territory. We are being informed that our own forces are crumbling at the sight of the enemy, with most retreating without putting up any resistance. Chaos and mass desertions are occurring all along the front. 

@post_battle
go-to: defeat_2 if battle_outcome = -2; defeat_1 if battle_outcome = -1 
on-arrival: in_defensive_battle = 0;


@defeat_2
go-to: defeat_desc
on-arrival: {!
  Q.right_m_strength -= 5; Q.left_m_strength += 5; Q.m_strength += 5;
  Q.right_sr_strength -= 5; Q.sr_strength += 5; Q.lsr_strength += 10;
  Q.soldiers_lsr += 15; Q.soldiers_left_m += 5; Q.soldiers_sdi += 5;
  Q.soldiers_unrest += 15; Q.workers_unrest += 10; Q.peasants_unrest += 5;
  if (Q.german_negotiations >= 2) { Q.leftcom_strength -= 10; Q.leninist_strength += 5; }
  if (Q.b_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_b -= 15; }
  if (Q.lsr_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_lsr -= 5; }
  if (Q.sr_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_sr -= 5; }            
  if (Q.m_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_m -= 5; }
  if (Q.ns_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_ns -= 5; }
  if (Q.sdi_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_sdi -= 5; }
  Q.morale *= 0.8; Q.discipline *= 0.7; Q.train_capacity *= 0.85; Q.military_progress -= 2;
!}

>Our casualties: [+ friendly_casualties +]0,000 troops

>Enemy casualties: [+ hostile_casualties +]0,000 troops


@defeat_1
go-to: defeat_desc
on-arrival: {!
  Q.right_m_strength -= 2.5; Q.left_m_strength += 2.5; Q.m_strength += 2.5;
  Q.right_sr_strength -= 2.5; Q.sr_strength += 2.5; Q.lsr_strength += 5;
  Q.soldiers_lsr += 7.5; Q.soldiers_left_m += 2.5; Q.soldiers_sdi += 2.5;
  Q.soldiers_unrest += 7.5; Q.workers_unrest += 5; Q.peasants_unrest += 2.5;
  if (german_negotiations >= 1) { Q.leftcom_strength -= 5; Q.leninist_strength += 2.5; }
  if (Q.b_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_b -= 7.5; }
  if (Q.lsr_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_lsr -= 2.5; }
  if (Q.sr_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_sr -= 2.5; }            
  if (Q.m_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_m -= 2.5; }
  if (Q.ns_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_ns -= 2.5; }
  if (Q.sdi_in_gov == 1) { Q.soldiers_bsdi -= 2.5; }
  Q.morale *= 0.9; Q.discipline *= 0.8; Q.train_capacity *= 0.95; Q.military_progress -= 1;
!}

>Our casualties: [+ friendly_casualties +]0,000 troops

>Enemy casualties: [+ hostile_casualties +]0,000 troops

  
@defeat_desc

[? if front = "northern" and northern_progress = -2 : The Germans have captured Riga, and are marching ever closer to Petrograd. ?]
[? if front = "northern" and northern_progress = -3 : The Germans have taken Tallinn in Estonia, and are marching ever closer to Petrograd. ?]
[? if front = "northern" and northern_progress = -4 : The Germans are at the gates of Petrograd! ?]
[? if front = "western" and western_progress = -3 : The Germans have made further advances in Belarussia through Minsk, and are threatening central Russia. ?]
[? if front = "western" and western_progress = -4 : The Germans have entered Russia proper and are in a position to threaten many major cities. ?]
[? if front = "southwestern" and southwestern_progress >= -1 : The Germans have pushed the front further back in Galicia and western Ukraine. ?]
[? if front = "southwestern" and southwestern_progress = -2 : The Germans have entered Ukraine and are threatening Kiev. ?]
[? if front = "southwestern" and southwestern_progress = -3 : The Germans have conquered most of Ukraine. ?]



  
